1. Loads FP4 packed data into LDS
2. Dequantizes FP4→BF16 using fast bit manipulation (no LUT!)
3. Applies E8M0 scale during dequant (fold into exponent)
4. Feeds BF16 to __builtin_amdgcn_mfma_f32_16x16x16bf16_1k (well-documented)
5. Accumulates in f32, writes bf16

From petit-kernel: FP4 e2m1 dequant is just 2 AND + 2 SHIFT + 2 OR per 4 values.
